source: crates/rail/src/tui/modals/tests.rs
expression: text
---

                                   ┌ Keys (* set in config.toml) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
                                   │Thread list                                                                   │
                                   │  Enter                Open the thread                                        │
                                   │  x *                  Filter the list as you type                            │
                                   │  S                    Save the filter as a search                            │
                                   │  b                    Show or hide the sidebar                               │
                                   │  1                    Go to account 1's inbox                                │
                                   │  2                    Go to account 2's inbox                                │
                                   │  3                    Go to account 3's inbox                                │
                                   │  4                    Go to account 4's inbox                                │
                                   │  5                    Go to account 5's inbox                                │
                                   │  6                    Go to account 6's inbox                                │
                                   │  7                    Go to account 7's inbox                                │
                                   │  8                    Go to account 8's inbox                                │
                                   │  9                    Go to account 9's inbox                                │
                                   │  0                    Go to the unified inbox                                │
                                   │  Ctrl-r               Sync now; reconnect to the daemon                      │
                                   │  j, ↓                 Next thread                                            │
                                   │  k, ↑                 Previous thread                                        │
                                   │  PgDn, Ctrl-d         One page down                                          │
                                   │  PgUp, Ctrl-u         One page up                                            │
                                   │  Home, g g            Newest thread                                          │
                                   │  End, G               Oldest thread                                          │
                                   │  e                    Archive the thread or the selection                    │
                                   │  d                    Move to the trash (asks first)                         │
                                   │                       Move to the trash without asking (undo still works)    │
                                   │  s                    Star or unstar                                         │
                                   │  u                    Mark read or unread                                    │
                                   │  l                    Add or remove labels (Gmail)                           │
                                   │  m                    Move to a label (Gmail) or a folder (Microsoft 365)    │
                                   │  h                    Snooze until later, or return a snoozed thread         │
                                   │  c                    Write a new message                                    │
                                   │  g t                  Open the link the subject names                        │
                                   │  r                    Reply to the latest message                            │
                                   │  R                    Reply to everyone                                      │
                                   │  f                    Forward the latest message                             │
                                   │↓ more                                                                        │
                                   └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
